"name": "Verra Mobility Corp.",
"description": "Verra Mobility Corp. engages in the provision of smart mobility technology solutions. It operates through the following segments: Government Solutions, Commercial Services, and Parking Solutions. The Government Solutions segment offers automated safety solutions to state and local governments. The Commercial Services segment provides toll and violation management solutions by partnering with the fleet management and rental car companies. The Parking Solutions segment includes a suite of parking software and hardware solutions. The company was founded in 2004 and is headquartered in Mesa, AZ.",
